---
// Theory Search Empty State
---

<div class="theory-empty-state" id="theoryEmptyState" hidden>
  <div class="empty-state-card">
    <div class="empty-icon-box">🔍</div>
    <h3 class="empty-title">No Matching Theory Topics Found</h3>
    <p class="empty-desc" id="theoryEmptyDesc">Try searching for common scales like "pentatonic", chords like "G5" or rudiments like "paradiddle".</p>
    <button type="button" class="empty-reset-btn brutal-press" id="theoryResetSearchBtn">Clear Search Filter</button>
  </div>
</div>
